cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BGTS Context Engine"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, multi-language code-graph context engine for AI coding agents. It
  indexes a repository into a property graph over PostgreSQL with Apache AGE and pgvector,
  then assembles reproducible context packages through anchor discovery, graph expansion,
  scoring and narrowing, exposed over MCP and REST.
